__name__ = "NavDrawerBackground"
__description__ = "Кастомный фон карточки аккаунта для **[бокового меню](https://t.me/exteraSettings?s=navigationDrawer)**\nCustom account card background for **[navigation drawer](https://t.me/exteraSettings?s=navigationDrawer)**"
